xt":"smaller villages.","y":0.73154292942351884,"w":0.1228479003906251,"x":0.5819731118950312},{"h":0.016054713190818415,"text":"3 For those who love the outdoors, there is plenty to","y":0.74409629017678502,"x":0.55537731975428783,"w":0.40928279876708984},{"h":0.013255813754334711,"text":"do in the countryside in spite of \/ although the lack of","x":0.58222223181043831,"y":0.76000000014407432,"w":0.40444442749023435},{"text":"clubs, galleries and cinemas.","x":0.58222222161519388,"y":0.77616279113588871,"w":0.2155555534362793,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.55555556256372052,"text":"4 Although \/ Despite the air is clean and the noise","w":0.39111110687255868,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.78924418625459014},{"y":0.80286693035178402,"h":0.015007263494997591,"w":0.3847636413574218,"x":0.57985242277127957,"text":"minimal, there is little entertainment in the country."},{"h":0.013114617795360384,"w":0.42444442749023437,"y":0.81831395328182355,"text":"5 Finally, country life allows for clean and healthy living","x":0.55555556827710495},{"text":"close to nature despite \/ even though the distance","x":0.57999999786818235,"y":0.83265306139967354,"w":0.38222221374511722,"h":0.011836734693877471},{"x":0.57973082228891404,"y":0.845247059537379,"h":0.014020968067402828,"text":"from the amenities of the city.","w":0.22948362350463858}]